---
import { courseOutline, courseLessonHref } from '../../data/courseOutline';
---
<aside class="home-learning-promo" id="learning-paths" aria-labelledby="learning-paths-title">
  <div class="eyebrow">学习经济</div>
  <h2 id="learning-paths-title">从生活里的问题开始</h2>
  <p>不需要先记住一串名词。从一份早餐开始，看看购买、收入、生产和工作怎样联系起来。</p>
  <a class="home-learning-promo-primary" href={courseLessonHref(courseOutline[0].id)}>开始第一章 →</a>
  <a class="home-learning-promo-secondary" href="/learn/">查看学习主线</a>
</aside>
